<h1><span lang="EN-US">Combine</span></h1>
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-US">This command is accessible from</span> <b><i style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Transformations &gt; Combine</b></span></i></b><span lang="EN-US">.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US">Description</span>: The command</b> <span class="Command">Combine</span> <span lang="EN-US">is used to join two transformation matrices in a single one.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US"><img src="../transformation_menu/Transformations_files/image003.gif" width="321px" height="199px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><b>Name of new transformation</b>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Leave the default name or type a new one. <i><span lang="EN-US" style="font-style:normal;">The default name is ‘Transformation N’, where N is the number of the subsequent newly created transformation. When a transformation</span> is created the number N in the name will automatically increase.</i></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><b><span lang="EN-US">Select Transformation 1</span> and</b> 2:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-US">Listboxes for selecting respectively the first and the second transformations to combine.</span></p>
<p class="Warning"><span lang="EN-US">The user should be very careful when choosing transformations to combine. The matrices are multiplied by the order they are selected in the combine dialog.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><b><span class="Button" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Combine</b></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>button</b></span></b><span lang="EN-US">:</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-US">Combines the selected transformations, creates the new one and closes the dialog.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><b><span class="Button" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Cancel</b></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>button</b></span></b><span lang="EN-US">:</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-US">Closes the dialog without any changes.</span></p>
